<!--
  Simplified Chinese (issue #20). Maintained by Claude (the maintainer does not read Chinese - see
  CLAUDE.md's Localization section): every key added to Strings.resx gets its translation here in
  the same change. Style: Microsoft zh-Hans conventions (modern 你, full-width punctuation in
  prose); product/technical terms (Claude Code, CLI, token, acceptEdits, /ide, vs-debug, MCP,
  .claude) stay in English. Missing keys fall back to English per-string at runtime.
-->
